  "sourcePolicy": {
    "admission": "Explicit Start on loaded message attachment declarations only. Shared MIME essence or actual local .docx path selects DOCX; display name alone does not. MIME captured in owner and rechecked along with the existing message/thread/index ownership.",
    "source": "Bounded native source <=1MiB, exact seven fields on capture, parsed result and post-read revision. Explicit attachment navigation rechecks revision; snippets are never message offsets.",
    "text": "Validated author text only: adjacent style runs join, genuine tabs/breaks retained; images/alt, omitted notices and note markers are hard barriers. Paragraphs, cells and stories stay separate. Labels, JSON keys and warning copy are not searched.",
    "limits": "20files, two native-prefetch operations, one batch DOCX parser at a time, 16MiB actual searchable UTF8 aggregate and 200 displayed hits. Existing document parse/inflation budgets remain. Total disk IO is not claimed <=16MiB; bounded checks may reread sources.",
    "cancellation": "Worker AbortSignal and late-owner guards; already-started native captures still awaited. Pending is preserved as unknown, explicit retry only. No inferred OS stop.",
    "publication": "Only snippets and source/range metadata survive temporary results. Full extracted author content is not persisted."
  },
